== Tail rule in miss counts (N = 1e5 holes at the Auto r*, d = L_arq)
   a form f is refuted iff |k - mu_f| > 3*sqrt(mu_f * bbar)  (burst-inflated Poisson); no unassigned range:
   every k either refutes or keeps each form, independently
   c2 (bbar 2.00): shipped/phi mu 47, kept iff k in [19, 76] | C6 mu 2041, kept iff k in [1850, 2232] | C5 mu 2231, kept iff k in [2031, 2431] | target mu 39, kept iff k in [13, 66]
   c3 (bbar 2.50): shipped/phi mu 27, kept iff k in [3, 52] | C6 mu 1084, kept iff k in [929, 1240] | C5 mu 1340, kept iff k in [1167, 1513] | target mu 21, kept iff k in [0, 42]
